a . gbm
b . gbm + jump ( formula 2 . 16 in the book , figure 2 . 7 )
c . mean reversion + jump ( formula 2 . 17 , figure 2 . 8 )
4 . schwartz single factor model ( formula 6 . 12 )
5 . develop models corresponding to the figures 7 . 1 , 7 . 3 , 7 . 5 , 7 . 6 , 7 . 8
